{"seq":3,"slug":"guarantee-fund-reserve","title":"保障资金池与准备金","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/platform-advance-payout/guarantee-fund-reserve","wordCount":2765,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"保障资金池与准备金\">保障资金池与准备金</h1><p>前两篇处理了单笔赔付的判定与资金流向，但它们合起来只回答了一半问题：<strong>如果所有赔付同时发生，池子够不够？</strong> 这就是准备金问题——它在大促、节假日、或某类事件集中爆发时会立刻变成现实。一个只做了垫付判定和追偿设计的系统，如果没有准备金约束，会在赔付量激增的窗口期直接撞上资金池下限，届时要么暂停赔付（体验崩塌），要么临时注资（财务被动）。</p>\n<p>准备金规模不是拍出来的，它由三个可观测的量决定：<strong>赔付的期望值、赔付的波动性、以及追偿的回收率</strong>。本篇从这三个量出发，给出准备金的下限估算方法、池子的资金结构、以及超赔时的兜底与补池机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-资金池的三种结构\">核心概念：资金池的三种结构</h2><p>平台保障资金池在工程上有三种组织方式，选择哪一种决定了资金调度的复杂度与财务透明度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>池子类型</th>\n<th>资金来源</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一平台池</td>\n<td>平台预算统一注入</td>\n<td>简单、额度可集中调度</td>\n<td>无法归因到业务线，成本失控无早期信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按品类/市场分池</td>\n<td>按维度切分预算</td>\n<td>成本可归因，超赔可局部收紧</td>\n<td>池子多、调拨规则复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家保证金池</td>\n<td>从卖家收取保证金</td>\n<td>责任自担、激励约束强</td>\n<td>小卖家入场门槛高、回收仍需流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的主流是前两者的组合：<strong>按市场或品类分池，池与池之间保留一层调剂额度</strong>。纯平台单池的问题是成本失控没有早期信号——第四章的成本模型需要按维度看赔付率，如果资金只有一个池，这个维度就丢了。纯按维度分池的问题是长尾池容易在偶然事件下枯竭，需要一层调剂来平滑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  B[平台预算拨付] --&gt; P1[市场A池]&#10;  B --&gt; P2[市场B池]&#10;  B --&gt; P3[品类池]&#10;  P1 --&gt; F1[赔付支出]&#10;  P2 --&gt; F2[赔付支出]&#10;  P3 --&gt; F3[赔付支出]&#10;  R[追偿回收款] --&gt; P1&#10;  R --&gt; P2&#10;  X[调剂额度层] -.-&gt;|补池| P1&#10;  X -.-&gt;|补池| P2&#10;  T[超赔阈值告警] --&gt; X\">graph TD\n  B[平台预算拨付] --&gt; P1[市场A池]\n  B --&gt; P2[市场B池]\n  B --&gt; P3[品类池]\n  P1 --&gt; F1[赔付支出]\n  P2 --&gt; F2[赔付支出]\n  P3 --&gt; F3[赔付支出]\n  R[追偿回收款] --&gt; P1\n  R --&gt; P2\n  X[调剂额度层] -.-&gt;|补池| P1\n  X -.-&gt;|补池| P2\n  T[超赔阈值告警] --&gt; X</pre><h2 id=\"准备金下限的估算\">准备金下限的估算</h2><p>准备金要盖住的是<strong>在给定置信水平下、一个观察周期内的净赔付额</strong>。净赔付额等于赔付总额减去追偿回收额。用期望与波动表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>payout</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min} = \\mu_{\\text{payout}} \\cdot T - \\mu_{\\text{recover}} \\cdot T + z_{\\alpha} \\cdot \\sigma_{\\text{net}} \\cdot \\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是覆盖周期（例如一个月），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间的期望值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间净赔付的标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是置信水平对应的分位数（例如 95% 对应约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.645</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.645</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.645</span></span></span></span></span>）。这个公式的结构值得拆开看。</p>\n<p>前半部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>payout</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mu_{\\text{payout}} - \\mu_{\\text{recover}}) \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>期望净支出</strong>，它随周期线性增长。后半部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{\\alpha} \\cdot \\sigma \\cdot \\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>波动缓冲</strong>，它随周期的平方根增长——这是准备金管理最重要的一个性质：<strong>周期越长，波动缓冲的相对占比越小</strong>，因为独立事件之间会相互抵消。这解释了为什么长周期准备金不是短周期的简单倍数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"波动性从哪来\">波动性从哪来</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不能直接读出，需要从历史赔付数据估计，它的主要来源有三类，各自需要不同的处理。第一类是<strong>事件量的自然波动</strong>（泊松型），单位时间赔付笔数的方差约等于均值，这部分无法消除。第二类是<strong>单笔金额的重尾性</strong>，高价订单的赔付会显著抬高方差，因此对高价品类需要单独估计而不是并池。第三类是<strong>集中事件</strong>，例如某承运商某条线路大面积延误会让一周内的延迟赔付集中爆发，这类波动的方差远大于泊松假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么并池能降低准备金\">为什么并池能降低准备金</h3><p>把一个高价品类和一个低价品类放进同一个池子，所需的总准备金小于两个独立池的准备金之和。原因是波动项的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与相关性：若两类赔付的相关系数小于 1，合并后的标准差小于各自标准差之和。这就是分池与并池之间的基本张力——<strong>分池带来成本归因能力，并池带来资金效率</strong>。务实的设计是先按业务维度分池以满足归因需求，再在池子之上加一层调剂额度来逼近并池的资金效率，而不是二选一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"情景分析补足统计估计\">情景分析补足统计估计</h3><p>对第三类集中事件，用历史标准差估出来的准备金会严重不足。务实的做法是叠加一层情景分析：列出三到五个最可能的高赔付情景（某物流商停摆、某大促退货率翻倍、某品类集体鉴定异常），分别估算其在观察周期内的赔付额，取最大值作为<strong>压力下限</strong>，准备金取统计下限与压力下限的较大者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情景</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>估算方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承运商大面积延误</td>\n<td>单一路线延误率高于基线 5 倍</td>\n<td>受影响订单数 × 延迟赔付率 × 单笔赔付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促退货潮</td>\n<td>活动期退货率高于基线</td>\n<td>活动订单数 × 退货率增量 × 平均赔付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类鉴定异常</td>\n<td>某批次商品鉴定未通过率异常</td>\n<td>在途订单数 × 异常率 × 全额退款均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家集体跑路</td>\n<td>多卖家同时关店</td>\n<td>相关在途订单敞口合计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"补池与超赔的处置\">补池与超赔的处置</h2><p>准备金一定会被击穿，问题只是频率。届时的处置顺序决定了损害的大小。</p>\n<p>第一道防线是<strong>池间调剂</strong>，从其他富余的池子临时借入额度。它需要预设调剂规则（谁能借、借多少、何时归还），否则在真出事时会陷入审批僵局。</p>\n<p>第二道防线是<strong>收紧赔付策略</strong>。这不是停赔，而是把自动垫付的金额上限下调、把主观证据类事件转人工的比例提高——也就是把上一篇的判定参数向保守方向调整。这个动作必须提前设计成<strong>可在线切换的配置</strong>，而不是需要发版才能生效的代码。eBay 的条款里就保留了这种弹性：它明确说明在位置、配送服务、轨迹可得性、灾害、紧急状况、罢工或政府行为等有限情况下，平台可以延长各类期限（<a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/help/policies/ebay-money-back-guarantee-policy/ebay-money-back-guarantee-policy?id=4210\">eBay MBG 政策</a>）。这种「条款预留弹性」的做法，在工程上对应的就是可配置的策略开关。</p>\n<p>第三道防线是<strong>临时注资</strong>，由平台追加预算。这是最后手段，因为它的代价不只是钱，还有对外的可信度——如果注资消息外泄，卖家会预期平台必然兜底，从而放松履约。</p>\n<p>第四道防线（严格说不算防线）是<strong>暂停某类保障的继续售卖或继续赔付</strong>。这是产品层面的降级，代价最大，通常只在极端情况下使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE reserve_pool (&#10;  pool_id        BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pool_scope     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  balance        NUMERIC(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  floor_amount   NUMERIC(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  target_amount  NUMERIC(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  updated_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_pool_floor CHECK (floor_amount &lt;= target_amount)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE reserve_alert (&#10;  alert_id     BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pool_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES reserve_pool(pool_id),&#10;  rule         TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (rule IN&#10;                 (&#39;balance_below_floor&#39;,&#39;burn_rate_above_baseline&#39;,&#39;scenario_breach&#39;)),&#10;  observed     NUMERIC(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  threshold    NUMERIC(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  raised_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  resolved_at  TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reserve_pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pool_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pool_scope     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  balance        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  floor_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_pool_floor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (floor_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reserve_alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  alert_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pool_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserve_pool(pool_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'balance_below_floor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'burn_rate_above_baseline'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scenario_breach'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  threshold    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raised_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>floor_amount</code>（下限）与 <code>target_amount</code>（目标额）分离是一个必要设计。下限是触发告警与调剂的红线，目标额是正常运营希望维持的水平——它比下限高出一段缓冲，正是上面公式里的波动项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{\\alpha}\\sigma\\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0767em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。只设一个数值会导致池子在告警与补池之间高频震荡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"池子规模与产品设计的关系\">池子规模与产品设计的关系</h2><p>准备金规模最终会反过来约束第一章的产品设计，这是本 hub 唯一的闭环。如果某个保障产品的准备金占用过高（赔付额大、波动大、追偿回收率低），理性的选择是收缩它的承诺范围——缩短窗口期、降低赔付上限、或限制适用品类。这条反馈链路必须显式存在，否则产品团队会不断叠加新的承诺，而资金团队只能在末端被动补池。工程上的实现方式是把「单位承诺的准备金占用」作为一个产品级指标输出，在新增或调整保障产品时作为评审输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补池作业的触发逻辑\">补池作业的触发逻辑</h3><p>补池不应该靠人盯报表，而应由一个幂等的定期作业驱动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每 6 小时运行：对低于下限的池生成补池单&#10;INSERT INTO reserve_replenishment (pool_id, requested_amount, reason)&#10;SELECT p.pool_id, p.target_amount - p.balance, &#39;balance_below_floor&#39;&#10;FROM   reserve_pool p&#10;WHERE  p.balance &lt; p.floor_amount&#10;  AND  NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reserve_replenishment r&#10;                   WHERE r.pool_id = p.pool_id AND r.state = &#39;pending&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每 6 小时运行：对低于下限的池生成补池单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserve_replenishment (pool_id, requested_amount, reason)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pool_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'balance_below_floor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   reserve_pool p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">floor_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserve_replenishment r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pool_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pool_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>NOT EXISTS</code> 这一段是幂等的关键：没有它，作业每运行一次就会为同一个池子生成一张新的补池单，几张单据叠加后补池金额会远超所需。这类「周期性作业产生重复单据」的缺陷在资金类系统里非常常见，防御方式统一——<strong>在写入前检查是否存在同键的未完成单据</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个可落地的准备金看板字段\">一个可落地的准备金看板字段</h3><p>准备金监控看板不需要复杂，但下列字段缺一不可，否则无法区分「正常消耗」与「异常击穿」：<code>balance</code>（当前池余额，与下限比较触发告警）、<code>burn_rate_7d</code>（近 7 日净支出速率）、<code>days_to_floor</code>（按当前速率耗尽至下限的天数）、<code>recovery_pending</code>（在途追偿额，用于修正净支出预估）、<code>scenario_max</code>（压力情景预估赔付，与余额比较预警）。</p>\n<p><code>days_to_floor</code> 是这张表里最有决策价值的字段。余额本身不说明问题——一个余额很低的池子如果支出速率也接近零，并不需要干预；反之一个余额充裕但支出速率异常高的池子，可能在几天内见底。把余额与速率合成一个「还有几天到红线」，才让告警具备可操作性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标组合</th>\n<th>判断</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>余额低 + 速率低</td>\n<td>稳定低位运行</td>\n<td>观察，无需干预</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余额低 + 速率高</td>\n<td>即将击穿</td>\n<td>立即调剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余额高 + 速率高</td>\n<td>异常消耗</td>\n<td>排查是否集中事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余额高 + 速率低</td>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>资金池按<strong>市场/品类分池 + 调剂层</strong>组织，单池会丢失成本归因，纯分池会在长尾枯竭。</li>\n<li>准备金下限 = 期望净支出 + 波动缓冲，<strong>波动缓冲随周期按平方根增长</strong>，因此长周期不是短周期的线性放大。</li>\n<li>波动的三类来源（泊松型、重尾金额、集中事件）需要不同处理，集中事件必须用<strong>情景分析</strong>覆盖。</li>\n<li>池子应设<strong>下限与目标额两个值</strong>，只设一个会导致补池震荡。</li>\n<li>超赔处置按<strong>调剂 → 收紧策略 → 注资 → 降级产品</strong>的顺序，其中策略收紧必须是在线可切换的配置。</li>\n<li>准备金占用会<strong>反压产品设计</strong>，这是本 hub 唯一的闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>资金池决定了钱够不够赔，但一个保障产品是否值得继续提供，取决于它的期望成本——见 <a href=\"../guarantee-cost-ops/payout-rate-cost-model\">赔付率与保障成本模型</a>。垫付判定与追偿流程分别见 <a href=\"advance-compensation-decision\">先行赔付资格判定</a> 与 <a href=\"platform-advance-recover\">平台垫付与向商家追偿</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保障资金池与准备金","id":"保障资金池与准备金"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：资金池的三种结构","id":"核心概念-资金池的三种结构"},{"level":2,"text":"准备金下限的估算","id":"准备金下限的估算"},{"level":3,"text":"波动性从哪来","id":"波动性从哪来"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么并池能降低准备金","id":"为什么并池能降低准备金"},{"level":3,"text":"情景分析补足统计估计","id":"情景分析补足统计估计"},{"level":2,"text":"补池与超赔的处置","id":"补池与超赔的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"池子规模与产品设计的关系","id":"池子规模与产品设计的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"补池作业的触发逻辑","id":"补池作业的触发逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"一个可落地的准备金看板字段","id":"一个可落地的准备金看板字段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平台垫付与向商家追偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/platform-advance-payout/platform-advance-recover"},"next":{"title":"承诺违约自动识别（超时/货不对板）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/promise-fulfillment-monitor/promise-breach-detect"}}